 "cues": [
  {
   "s": 3.15,
   "e": 6.047,
   "text": "ACR is the Arc Compute Rate:"
  },
  {
   "s": 6.087,
   "e": 8.3,
   "text": "a reference rate for machine commerce."
  },
  {
   "s": 8.34,
   "e": 11.005,
   "text": "It brings compute benchmarks, billing evidence,"
  },
  {
   "s": 11.045,
   "e": 14.506,
   "text": "and on-chain infrastructure into one place."
  },
  {
   "s": 14.956,
   "e": 18.898,
   "text": "Here are its inference, GPU, and data indices."
  },
  {
   "s": 18.938,
   "e": 21.789,
   "text": "Aomi helps users investigate compute bills using"
  },
  {
   "s": 21.829,
   "e": 25.04,
   "text": "ACR’s evidence and public price comparisons."
  },
  {
   "s": 25.08,
   "e": 26.421,
   "text": "Evidence age matters,"
  },
  {
   "s": 26.461,
   "e": 29.563,
   "text": "and a benchmark never authorizes payment."
  },
  {
   "s": 30.013,
   "e": 32.69,
   "text": "This is more than an API integration."
  },
  {
   "s": 32.73,
   "e": 36.219,
   "text": "ACR has an on-chain oracle, attestations,"
  },
  {
   "s": 36.259,
   "e": 38.351,
   "text": "and settlement infrastructure."
  },
  {
   "s": 38.442,
   "e": 40.445,
   "text": "Aomi connects protocol-specific"
  },
  {
   "s": 40.485,
   "e": 42.547,
   "text": "knowledge and off-chain records"
  },
  {
   "s": 42.587,
   "e": 46.709,
   "text": "to a harness that can prepare reviewed contract actions."
  },
  {
   "s": 47.16,
   "e": 48.223,
   "text": "For treasury payments,"
  },
  {
   "s": 48.263,
   "e": 50.812,
   "text": "the recorded bill determines the recipient,"
  },
  {
   "s": 50.852,
   "e": 53.575,
   "text": "amount, category, and decision hash."
  },
  {
   "s": 53.615,
   "e": 56.605,
   "text": "Aomi stages spendAsOwner, simulates it,"
  },
  {
   "s": 56.645,
   "e": 58.846,
   "text": "and requests owner authorization."
  },
  {
   "s": 58.886,
   "e": 61.586,
   "text": "The guard restricts chain, contract, and function;"
  },
  {
   "s": 61.626,
   "e": 63.78,
   "text": "PolicyWallet enforces ownership,"
  },
  {
   "s": 63.82,
   "e": 66.643,
   "text": "budget, and replay protection."
  },
  {
   "s": 67.093,
   "e": 70.884,
   "text": "After payment, ACR verifies the successful receipt and"
  },
  {
   "s": 70.924,
   "e": 73.984,
   "text": "matching event before reconciling the original bill."
  },
  {
   "s": 74.024,
   "e": 76.562,
   "text": "That closes the loop: off-chain evidence,"
  },
  {
   "s": 76.602,
   "e": 78.408,
   "text": "authorized on-chain action,"
  },
  {
   "s": 78.448,
   "e": 81.421,
   "text": "and a business record that knows what settled."
  },
  {
   "s": 81.872,
   "e": 85.454,
   "text": "Back in the product, Ask ACR Agent is the entry point."
  },
  {
   "s": 85.494,
   "e": 88.194,
   "text": "The merged frontend imports Aomi’s widget"
  },
  {
   "s": 88.234,
   "e": 90.957,
   "text": "and pins it to the hosted ACR app."
  },
  {
   "s": 90.997,
   "e": 92.966,
   "text": "The protocol keeps its own interface;"
  },
  {
   "s": 93.006,
   "e": 95.875,
   "text": "the component supplies the conversation."
  },
  {
   "s": 96.325,
   "e": 99.617,
   "text": "That is the foundation for one-shotting a protocol app."
  },
  {
   "s": 99.657,
   "e": 101.951,
   "text": "Describe the workflow, connect the infrastructure,"
  },
  {
   "s": 101.991,
   "e": 104.76,
   "text": "and define the contract actions and guards."
  },
  {
   "s": 104.8,
   "e": 107.501,
   "text": "Aomi supplies the agent runtime and frontend"
  },
  {
   "s": 107.541,
   "e": 110.7,
   "text": "component around those protocol-specific pieces."
  },
  {
   "s": 111.15,
   "e": 113.339,
   "text": "The frontend integration is shipped."
  },
  {
   "s": 113.379,
   "e": 115.777,
   "text": "The treasury workflow is implemented,"
  },
  {
   "s": 115.817,
   "e": 118.273,
   "text": "with production payment acceptance still pending."
  },
  {
   "s": 118.313,
   "e": 120.642,
   "text": "The value is one agent that connects"
  },
  {
   "s": 120.682,
   "e": 123.899,
   "text": "understanding the protocol with acting on it."
  }
 ],
